sequenceDiagram
    participant Server
    participant Websock
    participant RFB
    participant Inflate
    participant Decoder
    participant Display

    Server->>Websock: Compressed Framebuffer Data
    Websock->>RFB: Binary Message
    RFB->>Inflate: Provide Compressed Block
    Inflate->>RFB: Decompressed Bytes
    RFB->>Decoder: Raw Pixel Data
    Decoder->>Display: Rendered Frame
